 on users driving behavior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":172747,"global_rank":418031},{"name":"wangrui24/wangrui.github.io","owner":"wangrui24","html_url":"https://github.com/wangrui24/wangrui.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Github Pages template for academic personal websites, forked from mmistakes/minimal-mistakes","topics":[],"score":172745,"global_rank":418032},{"name":"sannidhi/packo","owner":"sannidhi","html_url":"https://github.com/sannidhi/packo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Run all of kpack's image builds in parallel","topics":[],"score":172739,"global_rank":418033},{"name":"datatalking/billionaireVis","owner":"datatalking","html_url":"https://github.com/datatalking/billionaireVis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"(Work in progress) Visualization of billionaires by industry. Data from https://think.cs.vt.edu/corgis/python/billionaires/billionaires.html","topics":[],"score":172738,"global_rank":418034},{"name":"natebru/AzureARMMods","owner":"natebru","html_url":"https://github.com/natebru/AzureARMMods","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Added some modifications to the Azure ARM Public templates","topics":[],"score":172737,"global_rank":418035},{"name":"agarner101/ReactSocks","owner":"agarner101","html_url":"https://github.com/agarner101/ReactSocks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Simple Socket tester in React","topics":[],"score":172737,"global_rank":418036},{"name":"trivikr/yarn-pnp-tsserver-not-found","owner":"trivikr","html_url":"https://github.com/trivikr/yarn-pnp-tsserv